{"3883070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speakeasy Simulator", "steam_appid": 3883070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the shadows of Prohibition. </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1923, Hidden from prying eyes, your speakeasy becomes an elegant refuge where craftsmanship takes time. Experiment with recipes, refine the quality of your spirits, and grow your bar at your own pace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speakeasy Simulator, combine craftsmanship, optimization, and decoration to create a unique venue shaped by your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce &amp; Distill Alcohol </strong><br> Transform fruits, vegetables, cereals, and other ingredients into fine illegal spirits. Control the quantity, quality, and production flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c8802760c3991f8f827c5d909eaf791b.poster.avif?t=1774037283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c8802760c3991f8f827c5d909eaf791b.webm?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c8802760c3991f8f827c5d909eaf791b.mp4?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Bar &amp; Laboratory </strong><br> Arrange your speakeasy and distillery to optimize production, storage, and service. A well-organized space means smoother operations and happier customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/78c1f05e54b58113034cb7599e93d624.poster.avif?t=1774037283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/78c1f05e54b58113034cb7599e93d624.webm?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/78c1f05e54b58113034cb7599e93d624.mp4?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Your Products</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In bulk to the mafia</strong> for fast cash. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per glass in your bar</strong> to satisfy the local clientele and earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/a2f4e641ee76da0591050ea2e5692abe.poster.avif?t=1774037283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/a2f4e641ee76da0591050ea2e5692abe.webm?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/a2f4e641ee76da0591050ea2e5692abe.mp4?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bar Decoration &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add furniture, lights, trim, decorative elements as well as wall, floor and ceiling appearances to personalize your bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new customization options by gaining <strong>reputation with your customers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c4a1cfb751d82063ec46e0859c56c043.poster.avif?t=1774037283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c4a1cfb751d82063ec46e0859c56c043.webm?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c4a1cfb751d82063ec46e0859c56c043.mp4?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Demands Matter </strong><br> Each visitor has specific expectations (type of alcohol, quantity, and quality). Meeting their needs builds reputation and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/e63e6dce3f813ce7f990a6daeaecaac4.poster.avif?t=1774037283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/e63e6dce3f813ce7f990a6daeaecaac4.webm?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/e63e6dce3f813ce7f990a6daeaecaac4.mp4?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade Police Patrols </strong><br> Be careful of police patrols outside, especially at night, and try to avoid them while smuggling contraband to your local reseller.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/0b8ffa57a23d4a7a3908c9d2e2cb773d.poster.avif?t=1774037283\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/0b8ffa57a23d4a7a3908c9d2e2cb773d.webm?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/0b8ffa57a23d4a7a3908c9d2e2cb773d.mp4?t=1774037283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Current State</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully playable, with a <strong>8 to 12 hours experience</strong> depending on your playstyle. You can produce alcohol, manage your bar and lab, sell to customers or mafia, decorate your bar and play around the police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The city is thirsty. The law is watching. </i></strong><br><i> Will your operation thrive or get busted?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the shadows of Prohibition. </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1923, Hidden from prying eyes, your speakeasy becomes an elegant refuge where craftsmanship takes time. Experiment with recipes, refine the quality of your spirits, and grow your bar at your own pace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speakeasy Simulator, combine craftsmanship, optimization, and decoration to create a unique venue shaped by your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce &amp; Distill Alcohol </strong><br> Transform fruits, vegetables, cereals, and other ingredients into fine illegal spirits. Control the quantity, quality, and production flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c8802760c3991f8f8